# Summary 
Expose the entire [fastify route options api](https://www.fastify.io/docs/v3.29.x/Reference/Routes/#routes-options) to provide greater flexibility.

# Test Plan
- Confirm all tests pass
- Update one of the examples with `routeOptions` , eg.
```js
// examples/basic
  fastify.register(fastifyCloudPrnt, {
    // ... other cloudprnt opts
    routeOptions: {
      preValidation: async function (req, reply) {
        throw new Error('test preHandler')
      }
    }
  })
```
- Start the example
  `npm run example:basic`
- Make a test request
```
curl http://localhost:3000/cloud-prnt
```
- Confirm the configured preValidation. handler runs
```
{"statusCode":500,"error":"Internal Server Error","message":"test preHandler"}
```

